# Three Lesson cards are in the graveyard (Accumulate Wisdom, Abandon Attachments and Boomerang Basics): "Put each of those
# cards into your hand instead", so all three of the top three go to the hand and nothing goes to the bottom, and the
# player is asked no question about it (`! Bot1.Arrange`).
# Turn 1: Accumulate Wisdom (graveyard has no Lesson) takes the second Accumulate Wisdom, the Plains go to the bottom.
# Abandon Attachments discards Boomerang Basics and draws Brainstorm and Ancestral Recall. Turn 3 (Bot1's second): draw
# Forest, then the second Accumulate Wisdom with the Moxen's mana looks at Counterspell, Lightning Bolt, Dark Ritual.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Accumulate Wisdom
Abandon Attachments
Boomerang Basics
Accumulate Wisdom
Plains
Plains
Brainstorm
Ancestral Recall
Forest
Counterspell
Lightning Bolt
Dark Ritual
Swamp x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Accumulate Wisdom.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Arrange(Accumulate Wisdom | Plains; Plains)
Bot1.Hand.Abandon Attachments.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Boomerang Basics)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Accumulate Wisdom.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Arrange
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Accumulate Wisdom; Abandon Attachments; Boomerang Basics; Accumulate Wisdom
Bot1.Hand = Brainstorm; Ancestral Recall; Forest; Counterspell; Lightning Bolt; Dark Ritual
Bot1.Library = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Plains; Plains
Stack.Count = 0
